   This directory vendors the puter.js client SDK (https://github.com/HeyPuter/puter,
   `src/puter-js`), which is licensed Apache-2.0 by Puter Technologies Inc.

   We ship ONLY the Apache-2.0 client SDK. We do NOT ship the Puter desktop GUI or
   backend (those are AGPL-3.0). The parent-side `ui` broker and the local `api_origin`
   that this SDK talks to are Vita's own implementation — see
   architecture/puter-compat-layer.md.
